flowchart LR
    User([사용자])

    subgraph UI["Controller / Flet View"]
        Main["main.py"]
        SearchView["SearchView"]
        DeckBuilderView["DeckBuilderView"]
        SavedDecksView["SavedDecksView"]
    end

    subgraph Services["Service Layer"]
        InitSvc["InitializeService"]
        SearchSvc["CardSearchService"]
        DetailSvc["CardDetailService"]
        BuilderSvc["DeckBuilderService"]
        ValidationSvc["DeckValidationService"]
        SavedSvc["SavedDeckService"]
    end

    subgraph Interfaces["Interfaces"]
        RepoIf["Repository Interfaces"]
        ProviderIf["CardDataProvider Interface"]
    end

    subgraph Implementations["Concrete Implementations"]
        DuckRepo["DuckDB Repositories"]
        YgoProvider["YgoProDeckProvider"]
    end

    DuckDB[(DuckDB)]
    API["YGOPRODeck Public API"]
    Cache["JSON Cache / Fallback"]

    User --> Main
    Main --> SearchView
    Main --> DeckBuilderView
    Main --> SavedDecksView

    SearchView --> SearchSvc
    SearchView --> DetailSvc
    DeckBuilderView --> BuilderSvc
    DeckBuilderView --> ValidationSvc
    DeckBuilderView --> SavedSvc
    SavedDecksView --> SavedSvc
    Main --> InitSvc

    Services -. "DIP: 추상화에 의존" .-> RepoIf
    Services -. "DIP: 추상화에 의존" .-> ProviderIf

    RepoIf <|.. DuckRepo
    ProviderIf <|.. YgoProvider

    DuckRepo --> DuckDB
    YgoProvider --> API
    YgoProvider --> Cache

    Bootstrap["app/bootstrap.py<br/>Dependency Injection"] -. "구현체 생성/주입" .-> Services
    Bootstrap -.-> DuckRepo
    Bootstrap -.-> YgoProvider
